{"code": 200, "name": "baidu", "title": "百度", "type": "热搜", "params": {"type": {"name": "热搜类别", "type": {"realtime": "热搜", "novel": "小说", "movie": "电影", "teleplay": "电视剧", "car": "汽车", "game": "游戏"}}}, "link": "https://top.baidu.com/board", "total": 30, "fromCache": true, "updateTime": "2026-09-18T23:54:55.427Z", "data": [{"id": 0, "title": "总书记为先进制造业指明方向", "desc": "“持续做大做强先进制造业，提升产业链自主可控水平，加快构建以先进制造业为骨干的现代化产业体系，巩固壮大实体经济根基，为推进中国式现代化提供有力支撑。”全国先进制造业大会9月16日至17日在京召开，会上传达的习近平总书记重要指示，为“十五五”乃至未来更长一段时间持续推动先进制造业发展指明前进方向、提供重要遵循。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/0fed28fde5f86aa98867aef80c332576", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7904464, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%80%BB%E4%B9%A6%E8%AE%B0%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%88%E8%BF%9B%E5%88%B6%E9%80%A0%E4%B8%9A%E6%8C%87%E6%98%8E%E6%96%B9%E5%90%91", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%80%BB%E4%B9%A6%E8%AE%B0%E4%B8%BA%E5%85%88%E8%BF%9B%E5%88%B6%E9%80%A0%E4%B8%9A%E6%8C%87%E6%98%8E%E6%96%B9%E5%90%91"}, {"id": 0, "title": "养生的风终于吹到了月饼行业", "desc": "今年中秋临近，记者走访北京市场发现，月饼企业纷纷推出低糖、低GI、药食同源等健康概念产品。此前高油高糖月饼常被诟病，73%消费者优先选择健康产品。如今部分减糖月饼销量飙升2倍，健康化已从风口变成标配，将倒逼行业迎来新一轮洗牌。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/935dd38e3461b3611a86e5c11d950f7c", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7809319, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%85%BB%E7%94%9F%E7%9A%84%E9%A3%8E%E7%BB%88%E4%BA%8E%E5%90%B9%E5%88%B0%E4%BA%86%E6%9C%88%E9%A5%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%9A", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%85%BB%E7%94%9F%E7%9A%84%E9%A3%8E%E7%BB%88%E4%BA%8E%E5%90%B9%E5%88%B0%E4%BA%86%E6%9C%88%E9%A5%BC%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%9A"}, {"id": 1, "title": "将与机顶盒合体 一体化电视什么样", "desc": "17日，国家广播电视总局介绍，今年将制定一体化电视技术标准，将机顶盒功能以软件内置，实现“开机进直播，一键看电视”，年内目标部署数千万台。此前，机顶盒操作繁琐困扰用户，今年6月15日广电总局已发布相关标准。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/146f3627636db79cd4622861e93dca60", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7713150, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%B0%86%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%BA%E9%A1%B6%E7%9B%92%E5%90%88%E4%BD%93%20%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E5%8C%96%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%86%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%A0%B7", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%B0%86%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%BA%E9%A1%B6%E7%9B%92%E5%90%88%E4%BD%93+%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E5%8C%96%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%86%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%A0%B7"}, {"id": 2, "title": "绘就丰收画卷 这四个地方给出答案", "desc": "金秋时节，陕西延安、黑龙江北安、广东梅州与广西柳州四地迎来丰收。延安苹果全产业链产值突破600亿元；北安玉米全产业链带动种植户户均年增收2800元以上；梅州金柚通过科技赋能实现稳产提质；柳州粉用稻全产业链综合产值持续提升。四地通过延伸产业链等方式带动农户增收致富。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/54a679787bbcce66df75bf787553f7c2", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7618728, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BB%98%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%B0%E6%94%B6%E7%94%BB%E5%8D%B7%20%E8%BF%99%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%AA%E5%9C%B0%E6%96%B9%E7%BB%99%E5%87%BA%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BB%98%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%B0%E6%94%B6%E7%94%BB%E5%8D%B7+%E8%BF%99%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%AA%E5%9C%B0%E6%96%B9%E7%BB%99%E5%87%BA%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88"}, {"id": 3, "title": "拖欠员工公积金 娃哈哈致歉", "desc": "9月18日，娃哈哈发布说明致歉，称相关补缴款项已划入鸡西市住房公积金管理中心指定账户，正办理逐人入账。此前，黑龙江虎林市宏胜饮料有限公司名下房产因欠缴近百名员工200余万元公积金，被法院查封，该基地已关停。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/628df73f993f56421f47aedc59c14124", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7520218, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%8B%96%E6%AC%A0%E5%91%98%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%AC%E7%A7%AF%E9%87%91%20%E5%A8%83%E5%93%88%E5%93%88%E8%87%B4%E6%AD%89", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%8B%96%E6%AC%A0%E5%91%98%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%AC%E7%A7%AF%E9%87%91+%E5%A8%83%E5%93%88%E5%93%88%E8%87%B4%E6%AD%89"}, {"id": 4, "title": "特朗普称获格陵兰岛永久安全控制权", "desc": "当地时间9月18日，美国总统特朗普在社交媒体上发文称，美国已与丹麦及其自治领地格陵兰岛达成一项协议，将获得对格陵兰岛安全及所有其他相关事务的“永久控制权”，美方无需为此支付费用。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/92e9d329fd7e0e0c095f5caf65f5d9bc", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7424882, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E7%A7%B0%E8%8E%B7%E6%A0%BC%E9%99%B5%E5%85%B0%E5%B2%9B%E6%B0%B8%E4%B9%85%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%9D%83", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E7%A7%B0%E8%8E%B7%E6%A0%BC%E9%99%B5%E5%85%B0%E5%B2%9B%E6%B0%B8%E4%B9%85%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%9D%83"}, {"id": 5, "title": "美驻日使馆9月18日发帖 日本网民破防", "desc": "9月18日，美国驻日本大使馆发帖纪念美军B-29轰炸机成功执飞首个从日本到美国的直飞航班81周年，引发大量日本网民“破防”不满并要求删帖。此前9月2日和3日，美俄驻日使馆发布二战纪念帖文时也曾遭日本右翼翻案挑衅。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/f7926f8bce5e8734473751f121556c13", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7332891, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BE%8E%E9%A9%BB%E6%97%A5%E4%BD%BF%E9%A6%869%E6%9C%8818%E6%97%A5%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%96%20%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E7%BD%91%E6%B0%91%E7%A0%B4%E9%98%B2", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BE%8E%E9%A9%BB%E6%97%A5%E4%BD%BF%E9%A6%869%E6%9C%8818%E6%97%A5%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%96+%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E7%BD%91%E6%B0%91%E7%A0%B4%E9%98%B2"}, {"id": 6, "title": "中国篮球之队回应负于日本男篮", "desc": "9月18日晚，中国篮球之队发文回应中国男篮在亚运会半决赛以77-97负于日本男篮。回应称比赛暴露出攻防多种问题，失利令人心情沉重，全队将深刻总结并调整状态，全力打好接下来的比赛。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/b6419a135779c8d692bd2cb2bfcf987b", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7237561, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%AF%AE%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E9%98%9F%E5%9B%9E%E5%BA%94%E8%B4%9F%E4%BA%8E%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%AF%AE%E7%90%83%E4%B9%8B%E9%98%9F%E5%9B%9E%E5%BA%94%E8%B4%9F%E4%BA%8E%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE"}, {"id": 7, "title": "毛东东随团访朝 向毛岸英铜像祭酒", "desc": "近日，中国青年干部代表团赴朝祭扫志愿军烈士陵园。成员毛东东在毛岸英烈士铜像前祭酒，并敬上从家乡带来的月饼，缅怀志愿军烈士。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/80779eb012844914c3679c7ab5f6666e", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7136801, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%AF%9B%E4%B8%9C%E4%B8%9C%E9%9A%8F%E5%9B%A2%E8%AE%BF%E6%9C%9D%20%E5%90%91%E6%AF%9B%E5%B2%B8%E8%8B%B1%E9%93%9C%E5%83%8F%E7%A5%AD%E9%85%92", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%AF%9B%E4%B8%9C%E4%B8%9C%E9%9A%8F%E5%9B%A2%E8%AE%BF%E6%9C%9D+%E5%90%91%E6%AF%9B%E5%B2%B8%E8%8B%B1%E9%93%9C%E5%83%8F%E7%A5%AD%E9%85%92"}, {"id": 8, "title": "于东来正被自己的人设绑架", "desc": "近日，于东来建议给家人花钱不超过三成收入，呼吁员工“为自己而活”，这番言论引发争议，他塑造的“大家长”人设逐渐束缚自身。早年胖东来因善待员工走红，如今网友不再盲从，认为企业经营不能简单归于个人理念，企业家应展现更立体的形象，回归真实的企业家精神。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/860361b26c621588cb988436ef593b59", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7045262, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%9C%E6%9D%A5%E6%AD%A3%E8%A2%AB%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E8%AE%BE%E7%BB%91%E6%9E%B6", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%9C%E6%9D%A5%E6%AD%A3%E8%A2%AB%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E8%AE%BE%E7%BB%91%E6%9E%B6"}, {"id": 9, "title": "高中生自制综艺走红 邓超李晨也参与", "desc": "近日，云南景洪高三学生陈乐维自制校园捉迷藏综艺走红网络，邓超、李晨先后出镜参与。他成绩下滑后选择艺考，面对“有资本团队”的质疑，称策划剪辑等核心工作均由自己完成，获得学校与家人支持。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/549355690fdbbad51d132dd54c2aebe8", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6944285, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E7%94%9F%E8%87%AA%E5%88%B6%E7%BB%BC%E8%89%BA%E8%B5%B0%E7%BA%A2%20%E9%82%93%E8%B6%85%E6%9D%8E%E6%99%A8%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E7%94%9F%E8%87%AA%E5%88%B6%E7%BB%BC%E8%89%BA%E8%B5%B0%E7%BA%A2+%E9%82%93%E8%B6%85%E6%9D%8E%E6%99%A8%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%8E"}, {"id": 10, "title": "绵阳一养猪场单日死亡500头猪不实", "desc": "近日，有网民发布帖文称，“四川绵阳三台有个代养大猪场，一天死了500多头”。经属地农业农村局核查，该帖文内容不实。近期未接到生猪集中发病、异常死亡相关报告，畜禽无害化处理量保持平稳，近三周无大幅波动。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/db4ea461aa237ede0e2763c150d741bb", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6858792, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BB%B5%E9%98%B3%E4%B8%80%E5%85%BB%E7%8C%AA%E5%9C%BA%E5%8D%95%E6%97%A5%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1500%E5%A4%B4%E7%8C%AA%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%9E", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BB%B5%E9%98%B3%E4%B8%80%E5%85%BB%E7%8C%AA%E5%9C%BA%E5%8D%95%E6%97%A5%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1500%E5%A4%B4%E7%8C%AA%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%9E"}, {"id": 11, "title": "油价预计9月24日24时上调", "desc": "国内加油站将会在9月24日24时进行油价调整。受到本周国际油价连续上涨的影响，目前国际原油变化率已达到10.94%，预计上调油价635元/吨。按照当前的上涨幅度，下周汽柴油价格每升继续大涨0.48元-0.57元，具体调价信息以最终发布为准。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/ffe6e6f2677a3add77f183b526e396b0", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6761616, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%B2%B9%E4%BB%B7%E9%A2%84%E8%AE%A19%E6%9C%8824%E6%97%A524%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%8A%E8%B0%83", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%B2%B9%E4%BB%B7%E9%A2%84%E8%AE%A19%E6%9C%8824%E6%97%A524%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%8A%E8%B0%83"}, {"id": 12, "title": "高校考试开考9分钟试卷就被外传", "desc": "近日，成都理工大学一期末考开考仅9分钟试卷便外泄，40分钟后全套答案在5万余人校园群聊公开。此前，一校外团伙利用考场短暂信号漏洞跨省作弊，牟利已三四载。校方称无权处置校外组织者，目前警方已正式介入案件侦办。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/be1e1f5ffaf00fecfa014a6362823392", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6660167, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%AB%98%E6%A0%A1%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E5%BC%80%E8%80%839%E5%88%86%E9%92%9F%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7%E5%B0%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%A4%96%E4%BC%A0", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%AB%98%E6%A0%A1%E8%80%83%E8%AF%95%E5%BC%80%E8%80%839%E5%88%86%E9%92%9F%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7%E5%B0%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%A4%96%E4%BC%A0"}, {"id": 13, "title": "产后失明失聪女子：从不后悔生娃", "desc": "", "cover": "https://fyb-1.cdn.bcebos.com/fyb/de6163834f53ca92c1273fff98ac9078.jpeg", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6570983, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BA%A7%E5%90%8E%E5%A4%B1%E6%98%8E%E5%A4%B1%E8%81%AA%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%8E%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8E%E6%82%94%E7%94%9F%E5%A8%83", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BA%A7%E5%90%8E%E5%A4%B1%E6%98%8E%E5%A4%B1%E8%81%AA%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%8E%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8E%E6%82%94%E7%94%9F%E5%A8%83"}, {"id": 14, "title": "花510万元“上天”能飞到哪里", "desc": "近日，某旅游平台上架一款6天行程的太空旅行产品，售价510万元起，旅客将搭乘维珍银河飞船体验90分钟的亚轨道飞行。专家杨宇光解读，亚轨道飞行目的地为100公里卡门线附近，因最大过载持续时间短，对身体要求较宽松，健康人群大多可承受。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/e4b0e01cf06bc3cbeacb9f10650ab906", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6470289, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%8A%B1510%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%8A%E5%A4%A9%E2%80%9D%E8%83%BD%E9%A3%9E%E5%88%B0%E5%93%AA%E9%87%8C", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%8A%B1510%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%8A%E5%A4%A9%E2%80%9D%E8%83%BD%E9%A3%9E%E5%88%B0%E5%93%AA%E9%87%8C"}, {"id": 15, "title": "超慢跑是一种更加友好的运动方式", "desc": "近年来超慢跑成为大众健身新热点。北医三院专家解读称，超慢跑具小步幅、高步频、轻落地特点，比快走有效且比慢跑轻松。其在高效燃脂同时对关节负荷小，能降低损伤风险，适合运动新手、中老年人及大体重人群。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/e0e7e9527328452a995b6f433205773b", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6375364, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%B6%85%E6%85%A2%E8%B7%91%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E6%9B%B4%E5%8A%A0%E5%8F%8B%E5%A5%BD%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%90%E5%8A%A8%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%B6%85%E6%85%A2%E8%B7%91%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%E6%9B%B4%E5%8A%A0%E5%8F%8B%E5%A5%BD%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%90%E5%8A%A8%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F"}, {"id": 16, "title": "51岁体操名将丘索维金娜7战亚运", "desc": "9月18日，51岁的体操名将丘索维金娜宣布，将第七次参加亚运会。曾经，她为患白血病的儿子而战，现在她仍在为自己而战。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/f78eb6f48439d58d313c679432077af1", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6279485, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=51%E5%B2%81%E4%BD%93%E6%93%8D%E5%90%8D%E5%B0%86%E4%B8%98%E7%B4%A2%E7%BB%B4%E9%87%91%E5%A8%9C7%E6%88%98%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%90", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=51%E5%B2%81%E4%BD%93%E6%93%8D%E5%90%8D%E5%B0%86%E4%B8%98%E7%B4%A2%E7%BB%B4%E9%87%91%E5%A8%9C7%E6%88%98%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%90"}, {"id": 17, "title": "男童在自家鱼塘触电截肢 索赔309万", "desc": "近日，河南长垣市人民法院对9岁男童触高压线截肢案作出一审判决。涉事供电公司因未竖立清晰警示牌，被判承担30%无过错赔偿责任，赔偿81万余元。此前，男童在自家承包鱼塘垂钓时，鱼竿触碰上方高压线致残，家属索赔309万余元。法院认定高压线高度达标，监护人未尽监护职责需担主责。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/2956e1c2bcc7508c655d07329644f426", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6192148, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%94%B7%E7%AB%A5%E5%9C%A8%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%B6%E9%B1%BC%E5%A1%98%E8%A7%A6%E7%94%B5%E6%88%AA%E8%82%A2%20%E7%B4%A2%E8%B5%94309%E4%B8%87", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%94%B7%E7%AB%A5%E5%9C%A8%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%B6%E9%B1%BC%E5%A1%98%E8%A7%A6%E7%94%B5%E6%88%AA%E8%82%A2+%E7%B4%A2%E8%B5%94309%E4%B8%87"}, {"id": 18, "title": "亚运再次失利 中国男篮差距何在", "desc": "9月18日，在亚运会男篮半决赛中，中国男篮以77:97不敌日本队，连续第二届无缘决赛。这场20分的失利，并非偶然的赛场失手，而是中国男篮在世界篮球快速迭代、亚洲诸强崛起背景下，长期积累的能力短板与体系差距的集中暴露。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/c93d00a6bce821ddfa73031e01712a6c", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6086507, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%90%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E5%A4%B1%E5%88%A9%20%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE%E5%B7%AE%E8%B7%9D%E4%BD%95%E5%9C%A8", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%90%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E5%A4%B1%E5%88%A9+%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE%E5%B7%AE%E8%B7%9D%E4%BD%95%E5%9C%A8"}, {"id": 19, "title": "中国男篮比分被修正为77比97日本", "desc": "北京时间9月18日，名古屋亚运会男篮半决赛中国男篮惨败日本无缘决赛。赛后比分由现场大屏的78比97修正为77比97，中国男篮最终输20分。此役不仅刷新亚运会最大输球纪录，也创下对阵日本最大输球纪录。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/17f9eb9c0954d85f9ad52260b0ad8a5b", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6000239, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE%E6%AF%94%E5%88%86%E8%A2%AB%E4%BF%AE%E6%AD%A3%E4%B8%BA77%E6%AF%9497%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE%E6%AF%94%E5%88%86%E8%A2%AB%E4%BF%AE%E6%AD%A3%E4%B8%BA77%E6%AF%9497%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC"}, {"id": 20, "title": "男子30层高空作业绳子被2楼老人剪断", "desc": "9月17日，广东佛山刘先生高空作业从30楼下到2楼时，发现绳子被2楼近80岁老人剪断。老人称不知有人作业，想当晾衣绳用。当事人未报警，经物业协调老人赔偿400元绳子钱。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/9ee683ff59d8f9583fff0b82cdf861a8", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5891823, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%94%B7%E5%AD%9030%E5%B1%82%E9%AB%98%E7%A9%BA%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A%E7%BB%B3%E5%AD%90%E8%A2%AB2%E6%A5%BC%E8%80%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%89%AA%E6%96%AD", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%94%B7%E5%AD%9030%E5%B1%82%E9%AB%98%E7%A9%BA%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%9A%E7%BB%B3%E5%AD%90%E8%A2%AB2%E6%A5%BC%E8%80%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%89%AA%E6%96%AD"}, {"id": 21, "title": "也门局势突变 又一个海峡危险了", "desc": "如今，曼德海峡已成为全球地缘冲突的又一个焦点。9月10日至11日，也门胡塞武装在不到48小时内接连夺取红海港口城市穆哈、曼德海峡核心岛屿丕林岛以及哈尼什群岛，实现了对这条承载全球约12%商品贸易和8%石油供应通道的全面控制。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/e4d220f4aff0b62cba40ab3c084633e5", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5803359, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B9%9F%E9%97%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8A%BF%E7%AA%81%E5%8F%98%20%E5%8F%88%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%B5%B7%E5%B3%A1%E5%8D%B1%E9%99%A9%E4%BA%86", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B9%9F%E9%97%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8A%BF%E7%AA%81%E5%8F%98+%E5%8F%88%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%B5%B7%E5%B3%A1%E5%8D%B1%E9%99%A9%E4%BA%86"}, {"id": 22, "title": "小球迷看男篮输了哭到颤抖", "desc": "9月18日，亚运会中国男篮77-97惨败给日本男篮，无缘决赛。看到中国队输了，一位小男孩哭到颤抖，其父亲也记录下了小球迷的伤心一刻。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/0d3c1418fac272c4a9b6bd877a5e80a0", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5698288, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%B0%8F%E7%90%83%E8%BF%B7%E7%9C%8B%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE%E8%BE%93%E4%BA%86%E5%93%AD%E5%88%B0%E9%A2%A4%E6%8A%96", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%B0%8F%E7%90%83%E8%BF%B7%E7%9C%8B%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE%E8%BE%93%E4%BA%86%E5%93%AD%E5%88%B0%E9%A2%A4%E6%8A%96"}, {"id": 23, "title": "陕西秦王级大墓或为秦始皇嫡祖母", "desc": "9月18日，陕西省考古研究院公布了陕西咸阳上召窑秦陵近年来的考古发掘成果。经勘探发掘，这座“亚”字形大墓确认是一处战国晚期秦王级别的墓葬，专家推测墓主可能是秦始皇嫡祖母华阳太后。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/7a4acff5f474f966800c8b26fcb7d52b", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5602284, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%99%95%E8%A5%BF%E7%A7%A6%E7%8E%8B%E7%BA%A7%E5%A4%A7%E5%A2%93%E6%88%96%E4%B8%BA%E7%A7%A6%E5%A7%8B%E7%9A%87%E5%AB%A1%E7%A5%96%E6%AF%8D", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%99%95%E8%A5%BF%E7%A7%A6%E7%8E%8B%E7%BA%A7%E5%A4%A7%E5%A2%93%E6%88%96%E4%B8%BA%E7%A7%A6%E5%A7%8B%E7%9A%87%E5%AB%A1%E7%A5%96%E6%AF%8D"}, {"id": 24, "title": "日本男篮12人里有5个归化混血", "desc": "亚运会日本男篮12人大名单引发热议，队伍中有5名混血及归化球员。严格来说，真正归化球员仅亚历克斯·柯克1人，其余4人为原生日本国籍的混血选手，二者概念不能混为一谈。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/f61a2106ac81cd2951d28b0d0ce26bdb", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5521920, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE12%E4%BA%BA%E9%87%8C%E6%9C%895%E4%B8%AA%E5%BD%92%E5%8C%96%E6%B7%B7%E8%A1%80", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE12%E4%BA%BA%E9%87%8C%E6%9C%895%E4%B8%AA%E5%BD%92%E5%8C%96%E6%B7%B7%E8%A1%80"}, {"id": 25, "title": "杨毅犀利点评中国男篮", "desc": "在名古屋亚运会男篮半决赛中，中国男篮77比97不敌日本队连续两届无缘决赛。赛后，评论员杨毅发文痛批中国男篮溃败，直言在溃败面前纠结对手是几队毫无意义，配文称“别提一队还是二队了，有资格说这个吗？”", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/857a01f29ac1d8997cc47848dd3462bd", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5424348, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%9D%A8%E6%AF%85%E7%8A%80%E5%88%A9%E7%82%B9%E8%AF%84%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%9D%A8%E6%AF%85%E7%8A%80%E5%88%A9%E7%82%B9%E8%AF%84%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE"}, {"id": 26, "title": "郭士强回应男篮惨败", "desc": "9月18日，亚运会男篮半决赛，中国队大比分不敌日本队，无缘决赛。赛后郭士强回应男篮惨败：“不会给自己打分，也不会任何队员打分。我们教练和球员都非常努力，大家都很辛苦。”", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/8d11108c71b94b496eeac8ff17e996ec", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5323206, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%83%AD%E5%A3%AB%E5%BC%BA%E5%9B%9E%E5%BA%94%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE%E6%83%A8%E8%B4%A5", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%83%AD%E5%A3%AB%E5%BC%BA%E5%9B%9E%E5%BA%94%E7%94%B7%E7%AF%AE%E6%83%A8%E8%B4%A5"}, {"id": 27, "title": "运动员展示亚运房间：全是纸板做的", "desc": "近日，新加坡铁人三项运动员展示亚运房间，掀开床板惊讶发现床是纸板做的，并称其很坚固。此外，其发现自行车架也是纸板做的。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/4b3e67c943b66b9089d8f3ebd5a65322", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5229491, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%BF%90%E5%8A%A8%E5%91%98%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%90%E6%88%BF%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%A8%E6%98%AF%E7%BA%B8%E6%9D%BF%E5%81%9A%E7%9A%84", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%BF%90%E5%8A%A8%E5%91%98%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%90%E6%88%BF%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%9A%E5%85%A8%E6%98%AF%E7%BA%B8%E6%9D%BF%E5%81%9A%E7%9A%84"}, {"id": 28, "title": "街头出现的这种超美植物千万别碰", "desc": "近日，杭州多个景区及路边石蒜（彼岸花）盛放。温馨提醒：石蒜全株有毒，含神经毒素，切勿采摘触碰。误食会恶心呕吐甚至呼吸困难，皮肤碰汁液会红肿发痒。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/b5d991da02e2ef36a7b3d888676cc626", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5142882, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%A1%97%E5%A4%B4%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%99%E7%A7%8D%E8%B6%85%E7%BE%8E%E6%A4%8D%E7%89%A9%E5%8D%83%E4%B8%87%E5%88%AB%E7%A2%B0", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%A1%97%E5%A4%B4%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%99%E7%A7%8D%E8%B6%85%E7%BE%8E%E6%A4%8D%E7%89%A9%E5%8D%83%E4%B8%87%E5%88%AB%E7%A2%B0"}]}